<title>POLAND: ESPEBEPE 1996 group loss at PLN 51.1 mln.</title>
<headline>ESPEBEPE 1996 group loss at PLN 51.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESPEBEPE SA consolidated results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						1996	    1995</p>
<p>    Group operating loss		31.91   vs    15.17</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax loss		  52.19   vs    21.23</p>
<p>    Group net loss			51.05   vs    20.88</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Espebepe SA</p>
<p>    Group net sales		    135.07   vs   141.20</p>
<p>    Group cost of sales		133.83   vs   123.76</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary loss	   2.20   vs     0.05</p>
<p>    Group income tax		     0.10   vs     0.26</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues	  49.09   vs     4.38</p>
<p>    Group financial costs	     55.14   vs    22.26</p>
<p>    Group investment		    11.92   vs     9.93</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
